<div class="wd-block" data-line="0" data-end-line="0" data-key="b80pzrmtam1c">
  <h1 id="commonmark-guide">CommonMark Guide</h1>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="2" data-end-line="2" data-key="297nuwvn9eq6c">
  <p>CommonMark is a strict, well-defined specification for Markdown. It focuses on the core features of Markdown without the extensions that some flavors like GitHub Flavored Markdown add. This guide shows CommonMark syntax.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="4" data-end-line="4" data-key="1ykwtzejbqh1c">
  <h2 id="about-commonmark">About CommonMark</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="6" data-end-line="6" data-key="1y901ta3jbo6f">
  <p>CommonMark is the standard Markdown specification. GitHub Flavored Markdown (GFM) adds useful extensions like tables, task lists, and strikethrough, but CommonMark represents the common core that all Markdown flavors share.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="8" data-end-line="8" data-key="27l9tbf7lepw">
  <h2 id="headings">Headings</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="10" data-end-line="10" data-key="1g58hjit5ag4c">
  <p>Six heading levels are available. The source shows all six; the rendered result shows levels 3 to 6 only, so the outline of this guide stays intact.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="12" data-end-line="19" data-key="hlialdb8so8j">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-heading tok-meta">#</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 1</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">##</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 2</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">###</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 3</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">####</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 4</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">#####</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 5</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">######</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 6</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="21" data-end-line="21" data-key="lou79an59my">
  <h3 id="heading-3">Heading 3</h3>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="22" data-end-line="22" data-key="b3i357lc61y">
  <h4 id="heading-4">Heading 4</h4>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="23" data-end-line="23" data-key="237d4lynrogy">
  <h5 id="heading-5">Heading 5</h5>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="24" data-end-line="24" data-key="asogl7mobny">
  <h6 id="heading-6">Heading 6</h6>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="26" data-end-line="26" data-key="1u115r0d1os24">
  <h2 id="paragraphs-and-text-formatting">Paragraphs and text formatting</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="28" data-end-line="32" data-key="43sz5yk3qsaa">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">This is a simple paragraph with <span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span><span class="tok-emphasis">italic text</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span> and <span class="tok-strong tok-meta">**</span><span class="tok-strong">bold text</span><span class="tok-strong tok-meta">**</span>.
You can also use <span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-strong tok-meta">**</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-strong">bold italic text</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-strong tok-meta">**</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span>.
You can include <span class="tok-meta">`</span>inline code<span class="tok-meta">`</span> in your text.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="34" data-end-line="36" data-key="uss4hal2u85s">
  <p>This is a simple paragraph with <em>italic text</em> and <strong>bold text</strong>.
You can also use <em><strong>bold italic text</strong></em>.
You can include <code>inline code</code> in your text.</p>
</div>
